WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.033
Three questions on the 2022

2
00:00:02.033 --> 00:00:02.540
Essay paper.

3
00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.920
No exam hall.

4
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.760
Just a ship, waiting politely in

5
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.610
a harbour.

6
00:00:09.371 --> 00:00:10.611
Question one.

7
00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:12.771
How many essays do you write in

8
00:00:12.771 --> 00:00:14.191
the Mains Essay paper?

9
00:00:14.191 --> 00:00:16.078
One. Two.

10
00:00:16.078 --> 00:00:18.414
Three. Four.

11
00:00:18.614 --> 00:00:21.968
Three. Two. One.

12
00:00:22.614 --> 00:00:25.394
Two: one from each section.

13
00:00:25.394 --> 00:00:27.014
About a thousand to twelve

14
00:00:27.014 --> 00:00:28.934
hundred words each, in three

15
00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:29.784
hours.

16
00:00:30.406 --> 00:00:31.746
Question two.

17
00:00:31.746 --> 00:00:34.646
A 2022 topic said poets are the

18
00:00:34.646 --> 00:00:36.486
unacknowledged legislators of

19
00:00:36.486 --> 00:00:37.026
the world.

20
00:00:37.026 --> 00:00:38.466
Who wrote that line?

21
00:00:38.466 --> 00:00:40.486
Wordsworth. Keats.

22
00:00:40.486 --> 00:00:42.176
Shelley. Tagore.

23
00:00:43.481 --> 00:00:46.661
Three. Two. One.

24
00:00:47.481 --> 00:00:50.761
Shelley, in A Defence of Poetry.

25
00:00:50.761 --> 00:00:53.241
Written in 1821, published in

26
00:00:53.241 --> 00:00:54.237
1840.

27
00:00:54.983 --> 00:00:56.343
Question three.

28
00:00:56.343 --> 00:00:58.743
A ship in the harbour is safe,

29
00:00:58.743 --> 00:01:00.443
but that is not what a ship

30
00:01:00.443 --> 00:01:01.283
is for.

31
00:01:01.283 --> 00:01:03.603
That topic sets safety against

32
00:01:03.603 --> 00:01:05.423
what? Speed.

33
00:01:05.423 --> 00:01:07.403
Cost. Pollution.

34
00:01:07.403 --> 00:01:08.933
Purpose and risk.

35
00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:12.805
Three. Two. One.

36
00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:14.894
Purpose and risk.

37
00:01:14.894 --> 00:01:17.474
A ship in harbour is safe, and

38
00:01:17.474 --> 00:01:20.054
also, let us admit, a little

39
00:01:20.054 --> 00:01:20.924
idle.

40
00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.362
For the essay:

41
00:01:23.362 --> 00:01:25.422
find the tension inside the

42
00:01:25.422 --> 00:01:28.402
topic. Safety against purpose.

43
00:01:28.402 --> 00:01:30.842
Then argue both ends, and finish

44
00:01:30.842 --> 00:01:31.972
on a balance.
